B.a0b=new A.am("Why is Playverzus piloting in Kenya first, and is it ready for global players?","Kenya leads the world in instant mobile-money adoption, making it the ideal live proving ground for real-time competitive escrow. While our Phase 1 pilot settles in KES via M-PESA, our global Visa/Mastercard and USDC settlement rails via Crossmint are already built and ready to activate worldwide.")
B.a0e=new A.am("How can game developers integrate their own games?","Register a Game Developer account, select your game's target platforms (PC, Console, Mobile, Web), and provide your Stats API endpoint and JSON field paths. Playverzus fetches live player stats and match results server-side.")
